314
00:05:16,245 --> 00:05:16,985
onion.

315
00:05:16,985 --> 00:05:17,849
In the freezer,

316
00:05:17,849 --> 00:05:18,763
it's the fish,

317
00:05:18,763 --> 00:05:19,874
the garlic bread and

318
00:05:19,874 --> 00:05:21,356
